# Ghost Vacuum puts each creature card exiled with it onto the battlefield at once (CR 110.2a, 603.6a): permanents that
# enter at the same time see each other enter. Bot1 discards two Hinterland Sanctifiers to Faithless Looting, exiles one with
# the Vacuum on turn 1 and the other on turn 3, and on turn 5 releases them together: each one's "Whenever another creature
# you control enters, you gain 1 life" triggers for the other, so Bot1 gains 2 (one at a time, only the first would see the
# second, for 1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Ghost Vacuum
Faithless Looting
Hinterland Sanctifier
Hinterland Sanctifier
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

